<TITLE>Rear Window Defogger System</TITLE>
<LIST1 TYPE = "UNORDERED"><ITEM><PTXT>A rear window defogger has been adopted on cold area specification models. In addition, a rear window defogger with a timer function (approximately 15 minutes) has been adopted.</PTXT></ITEM>
